{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>For [כי] — like the beating of the olive [כנוקף זית].</b> Like one who beats the olive, close in meaning to ונקף סבבי היער (Isaiah 10:34)." "<b>Like gleaning berries [כעוללו'].</b> And the meaning is a few, for after the vintage is finished, gleanings [עוללות] remain."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:54:57.127916526Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}